Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.25,0:00:47.46,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(770,540)}Soundtracking\N{\fs40}Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.75,0:00:51.88,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Let's travel all through the worldwide seas,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.96,0:00:54.22,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,raising our battle cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.34,0:00:58.55,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,If you've made up your mind, let the signal for departure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.72,0:01:00.97,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,ring out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.35,0:01:11.57,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,50)}That feeling we had when we set sail
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.63,0:01:15.03,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,is something I'll never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.22,0:01:16.82,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Because of that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.99,0:01:20.49,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,nothing will be able to scare me...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.76,0:01:26.75,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now, as the trip approaches, our racing heartbeats
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.94,0:01:33.67,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,engrave a rhythm of adventure in our shy hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.92,0:01:38.09,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,50)}Get all the treasures
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.18,0:01:40.35,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,while laughing out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.47,0:01:44.77,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Give them all out at a big party
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.85,0:01:47.44,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}making a splash...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.51,0:02:04.62,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Fill your empty heart with dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.74,0:02:06.96,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Spread your wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.18,0:02:11.29,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,If you color your heart with the blowing wind
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.38,0:02:13.63,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,you will move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.67,0:02:17.80,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get all the treasures
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.97,0:02:20.13,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,while laughing out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.26,0:02:24.49,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Give them all out at a big party
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.68,0:02:27.27,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,making a splash...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.83,0:02:38.61,Title,,0,0,200,,{\an8\fad(2000,2000}900號？！\N蘿拉的追擊與鼻歌劍士
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.84,0:02:41.76,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,喂，你在幹什麼，新來的？！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.76,0:02:46.74,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,我們殭屍是不可能違抗主人命令的...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.15,0:02:50.35,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,他怎麼能不服從？！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.35,0:02:53.60,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,而且，他的力量堪比將軍級！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.60,0:02:56.29,Main,Dog-Penguin,0,0,0,,簡單來說，那股無法阻擋的力量...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.29,0:02:58.53,Main,Dog-Penguin,0,0,0,,那股讓不可能變為可能的力量...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.53,0:03:01.95,Main,Dog-Penguin,0,0,0,,那股掃除一切障礙的颶風名為...！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.95,0:03:03.12,Main,Dog-Penguin,0,0,0,,愛！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.12,0:03:06.93,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,果然，那隻狗企鵝說的那些荒唐話...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.93,0:03:08.12,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,簡直跟香吉士一模一樣。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.12,0:03:09.81,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,喂，狗企鵝！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.81,0:03:11.61,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你知道香吉士的事嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.61,0:03:13.48,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我們是香吉士的夥伴，所以...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.48,0:03:17.92,Main,Dog-Penguin,0,0,0,,閉嘴吧，海賊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.48,0:03:15.09,Secondary,Usopp,0,0,0,,我們是香吉士的夥伴，所以...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.92,0:03:20.61,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他果然是我們的敵人！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.48,0:03:24.46,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.30,0:03:28.07,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,怎麼了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.07,0:03:30.23,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,等一下，蘿拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.27,0:03:34.34,Main,Both,0,0,0,,野豬？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.34,0:03:36.09,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.09,0:03:38.55,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,等一下，蘿拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.10,0:03:42.36,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,來抓我啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.65,0:03:46.77,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.77,0:03:48.57,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,我終於找到妳了...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.39,0:03:53.31,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,乂賊貓！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.98,0:03:55.29,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.29,0:03:56.86,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,等、等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.86,0:03:58.69,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我還什麼都沒偷呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.69,0:04:00.80,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,沒有用的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.80,0:04:03.91,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,我不會讓妳搶走阿布大人的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.18,0:04:08.64,Main,Dog-Penguin,0,0,0,,不准碰這位女士。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.64,0:04:11.66,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,不要多管閒事！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.38,0:04:17.29,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,狗企鵝！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.29,0:04:19.61,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他為什麼沒有攻擊？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.49,0:04:23.36,Main,Dog-Penguin,0,0,0,,就算我死...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.92,0:04:26.14,Main,Dog-Penguin,0,0,0,,我也絕對不會傷害女人！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.81,0:04:27.92,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,好厲害！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.92,0:04:31.16,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,能看出那傢伙是女人，你真是了不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.96,0:04:33.40,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,騙人布！喬巴！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.72,0:04:37.82,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,我得到新娘了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.82,0:04:40.23,Main,Both,0,0,0,,好厲害，娜美在飛！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.23,0:04:43.47,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,笨蛋，我是被綁架了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.95,0:04:45.08,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,被誰？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.16,0:04:46.97,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.44,0:04:50.13,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,那麼，我們馬上開始典禮吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.13,0:04:52.54,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,我已經準備好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.54,0:04:53.40,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,放我下來！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.40,0:04:55.96,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,你就是那個在浴室裡的透明人吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.54,0:04:58.40,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,這是真的嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.40,0:05:00.02,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,娜美！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.26,0:05:03.07,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,我已經對妳進行了評估。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.09,0:05:07.89,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,妳最適合成為我的新娘！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.34,0:05:11.26,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,我的名字叫阿布薩羅姆！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.83,0:05:14.01,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,這是妳未來丈夫的名字。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.01,0:05:15.91,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,一定要記住！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.63,0:05:22.36,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,你竟然偷看人家洗澡！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.36,0:05:26.07,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我每天努力保持身材，可不是給什麼變態野獸偷看的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.54,0:05:27.91,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}蓄電！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.64,0:05:37.14,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,娜美！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.36,0:05:40.43,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,幹得好！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.43,0:05:42.12,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我們趕快跑吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.08,0:05:44.86,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,離開這片森林！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.80,0:05:46.71,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.71,0:05:48.34,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,他還沒倒下！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.34,0:05:50.82,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,一看就知道他不是普通人！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.96,0:05:57.73,Thoughts,Absalom,0,0,0,,什麼...這股貫穿全身的衝擊...？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.73,0:06:03.60,Thoughts,Absalom,0,0,0,,就好像被雷擊中了一樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.60,0:06:08.29,Thoughts,Absalom,0,0,0,,難道...這就是...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.29,0:06:10.03,Thoughts,Absalom,0,0,0,,愛嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.20,0:06:13.26,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,妳逃不掉的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.72,0:06:16.32,Main,Zombies,0,0,0,,喂！不是發呆的時候！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.32,0:06:19.08,Main,Zombies,0,0,0,,抓住那三個人是我們的任務！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.08,0:06:20.09,Main,Zombies,0,0,0,,你說得對！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.09,0:06:22.79,Main,Zombies,0,0,0,,如果失敗了，乂洛娜大人的懲罰在等著我們！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.79,0:06:26.59,Main,Dog-Penguin,0,0,0,,不行！他們要追上那位女士了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.59,0:06:30.70,Main,Dog-Penguin,0,0,0,,可是，我為什麼要保護那個女孩？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.70,0:06:33.67,Main,Dog-Penguin,0,0,0,,而且，我動不了...！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.67,0:06:35.62,Main,Dog-Penguin,0,0,0,,這具身體太虛弱了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.18,0:06:38.30,Main,Zombies,0,0,0,,快去抓住那三個人！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.30,0:06:40.75,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,等一下，野生殭屍們！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.75,0:06:42.96,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,不准碰那個女人！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.96,0:06:45.00,Main,Zombies,0,0,0,,閉嘴，乂態薩羅姆！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.38,0:06:49.54,Main,Zombies,0,0,0,,我們接受主人的命令，但我們是乂洛娜大人的部下！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.54,0:06:51.22,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,我說了等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.80,0:06:58.44,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,我知道你們是乂洛娜的部下。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.44,0:06:59.37,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,但是...！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.37,0:07:04.06,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,你們應該知道不要惹我生氣。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.06,0:07:08.03,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,不要得寸進尺。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.64,0:07:11.99,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,你想幹嘛？！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.99,0:07:14.91,Main,Dog-Penguin,0,0,0,,我不會讓你們...去追那位女士。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.91,0:07:17.14,Main,Zombies,0,0,0,,喂、喂，新來的，住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.14,0:07:19.58,Main,Zombies,0,0,0,,不要惹阿布薩羅姆生氣！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.51,0:07:33.11,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,等一下，乂賊貓！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.11,0:07:36.20,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,喂，娜美！她好像只追妳一個人！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.20,0:07:38.95,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,對啊！我做了什麼了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.29,0:07:41.66,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我們分成兩組逃跑怎麼樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.46,0:07:45.86,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,你想丟下我，冷血怪物？！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.39,0:07:49.21,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,過來啊，可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.21,0:07:51.03,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,這野豬太可怕了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.99,0:07:58.62,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,難道他們...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.62,0:08:01.52,Flashbacks,Luffy,0,0,0,,你們這些混蛋在搞什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.52,0:08:02.88,Flashbacks,Luffy,0,0,0,,放我出去！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.77,0:08:08.80,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,就像現在的草帽仔一樣，被吸進牆壁的另一邊了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.80,0:08:11.32,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,猴子！猴子！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.25,0:08:17.89,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,很快你們也會落得同樣下場！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.33,0:08:21.77,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,兩邊都有無敵的殭屍向你們逼來。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.77,0:08:24.73,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,乖乖放棄吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.08,0:08:27.75,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我搞不清你到底是笨蜘蛛還是笨猴子，不過...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.75,0:08:33.28,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,千陽號降落時被纏住的那張巨大蜘蛛網就是你搞的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.47,0:08:36.57,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,沒錯！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.05,0:08:44.48,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,你們的一舉一動都會傳到乂洛娜大人的幽靈情報網。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.48,0:08:48.00,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,你那對大耳朵也是用來蒐集情報的吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.09,0:08:50.92,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,看起來聽力很好的樣子。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.40,0:08:53.74,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,你剛才說了什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.74,0:08:55.29,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,別裝了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.71,0:09:00.04,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,這是最壞的情況。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.04,0:09:02.64,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我們被完全包圍了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.12,0:09:06.14,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,看來我們急需一個對策。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.17,0:09:08.61,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,交給我來處理吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.17,0:09:10.71,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,隨你便。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.71,0:09:12.32,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,我來想辦法。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.30,0:09:14.99,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我其實很可靠的。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.99,0:09:17.34,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,那麼，開始吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.34,0:09:19.53,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,等等！你要幹什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.18,0:09:19.53,Secondary,Franky,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}風來...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.53,0:09:20.47,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}噴射！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.40,0:09:25.04,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,什...麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.06,0:09:28.71,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,你...把橋炸了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.61,0:09:35.08,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,嗯，就是這麼回事。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.08,0:09:36.39,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,還是跟以前一樣暴力。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.30,0:09:45.23,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}百輪花...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.30,0:09:45.23,Note,Robin,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}百朵花
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.23,0:09:50.34,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}羽翼！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.84,0:09:54.42,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你！你能飛？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.42,0:09:57.48,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,是的，大約五秒鐘。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.48,0:09:58.41,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,太短了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.10,0:10:00.89,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,不...足夠了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.40,0:10:03.92,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}強力右拳！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.23,0:10:07.96,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,好！接住了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.46,0:10:11.81,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,現在只要趕到那個入口，就能跟上草帽了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.61,0:10:13.61,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,抱歉。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.61,0:10:15.05,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,這是我的極限了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.95,0:10:17.01,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,拉回手臂！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.31,0:10:34.58,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,看來大家都掉進中庭了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.58,0:10:36.32,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,雖然不代表事情結束了，不過...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.32,0:10:38.64,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,他們暫時追不上來了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.64,0:10:40.07,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,進行得還算順利。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.07,0:10:42.12,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.12,0:10:44.95,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你竟敢把我當踏腳石？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.57,0:10:47.07,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.07,0:10:50.05,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,這不可原諒！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.05,0:10:51.81,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,我可是蜘蛛！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.81,0:10:54.25,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,我馬上就能回到那邊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.74,0:10:58.51,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,那是...什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.51,0:10:59.59,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,什麼...？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.59,0:11:01.93,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,有什麼東西...在掉下來？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.93,0:11:02.74,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.74,0:11:04.12,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,有人來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.25,0:11:08.40,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,只有骨頭！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.78,0:11:11.79,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,骨頭！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.79,0:11:14.01,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,喂，停下！停下來！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.01,0:11:15.54,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,不要殺她！她是我們的朋友！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.54,0:11:16.65,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.65,0:11:18.84,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,混蛋，住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.47,0:11:21.59,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,快逃，娜美！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.31,0:11:25.89,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,阿布薩羅姆是我的新郎！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.29,0:11:28.33,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,滾開！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.85,0:11:34.65,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,受死吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.54,0:11:37.88,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.52,0:11:39.84,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.16,0:11:40.97,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我、
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.97,0:11:42.22,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我...！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.16,0:11:44.49,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我其實是男人！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.09,0:11:51.06,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,喂喂。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.25,0:11:53.26,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,那是真的嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.26,0:11:54.36,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,沒錯！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.36,0:11:55.75,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,這是我的興趣！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.75,0:11:57.73,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,是認真的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.99,0:11:59.19,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,而且...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.19,0:12:02.41,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,你跟那個野獸男才是天造地設的一對！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.41,0:12:04.51,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我很支持你們！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.01,0:12:05.64,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,真的嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.64,0:12:06.45,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,真的！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.45,0:12:08.51,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,是認真的！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.32,0:12:14.39,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,從來沒有人這樣支持過我。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.39,0:12:21.61,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,你是第一個對我說這麼溫暖的話的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.61,0:12:22.47,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,我...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.47,0:12:24.44,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,我...！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.44,0:12:26.93,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,抬起頭來，朋友。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.10,0:12:31.08,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,這就叫做友情。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.08,0:12:32.71,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我的名字叫娜美藏。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.71,0:12:34.14,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,你可以叫我娜美。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.70,0:12:36.06,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,友情...！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.06,0:12:37.84,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,娜美！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.59,0:12:41.65,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,她上當了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.65,0:12:46.26,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,他醒著的時候當然不能貼上鹽巴。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.26,0:12:48.51,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,如果趁他睡覺的時候─
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.51,0:12:49.89,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,趁他睡覺的時候攻擊？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.89,0:12:51.85,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,做人可以這樣嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.85,0:12:54.30,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,可是，蘿拉妳不是殭屍嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.30,0:12:57.53,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,好過分！太卑鄙了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.53,0:13:00.36,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,只要他睡著了不會發現就沒關係。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.36,0:13:02.23,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,喂，娜美藏。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.23,0:13:03.80,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我們可以離開這裡了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.31,0:13:05.99,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,話說回來，蘿拉...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.99,0:13:08.93,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我之前在寶庫掉了一樣東西...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.65,0:13:13.54,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我想拿回來，但是不記得路了。你能告訴我嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.54,0:13:15.04,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,你真是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.04,0:13:16.20,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,不過沒關係。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.20,0:13:19.38,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,最近的路就是穿過那邊乂洛娜大人的房間。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.58,0:13:20.19,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,看到了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.19,0:13:24.66,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,她完全被騙了...短時間內不會出來。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.19,0:13:23.14,Secondary,Lola,0,0,0,,看到那座超高的塔了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.14,0:13:26.70,Secondary,Lola,0,0,0,,沿著那個方向直走就會看到通往那裡的樓梯。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.66,0:13:26.70,Thoughts,Chopper,0,0,0,,原來娜美一直是男人...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.52,0:13:30.76,Thoughts,Chopper,0,0,0,,我一直覺得她的行為有點男子氣概。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.79,0:13:33.97,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,喂，娜美，那傢伙追上來了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.97,0:13:35.18,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,真的嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.18,0:13:37.50,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,蘿拉！進攻機會！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.90,0:13:40.57,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我再也不會見到他了，放心吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.57,0:13:43.26,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,加油！你們兩個一定是最棒的一對！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.26,0:13:45.05,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,謝謝你，娜美！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.45,0:13:48.55,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,我現在充滿了勇氣！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.55,0:13:52.83,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,阿布薩羅姆！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.83,0:13:54.02,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,蘿拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.04,0:13:57.28,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,你們兩個，趁現在！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.28,0:14:00.21,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,那頭野豬果然沒有傷害娜美。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.21,0:14:01.90,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,娜美，妳太厲害了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.38,0:14:05.63,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,跟她說說話就會發現她其實不壞。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.63,0:14:08.07,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你又露出那種奇怪的表情了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.78,0:14:14.54,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,整艘船上連一個寶箱都沒有嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.54,0:14:18.00,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,有是有，但幾乎都是空的。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.00,0:14:21.01,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,剩下的只有少量的錢。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.01,0:14:25.86,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,我很驚訝這兩艘船幾乎沒有什麼戰利品。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.86,0:14:29.43,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,這真的是打敗克洛克達爾那個人的船嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.36,0:14:31.79,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,算了，無所謂。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.79,0:14:34.82,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,如果有食物的話就搬一些出來。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.82,0:14:35.70,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,是。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.70,0:14:37.41,Main,Hildon,0,0,0,,乂洛娜大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.24,0:14:39.48,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,乂爾頓。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.30,0:14:43.38,Main,Hildon,0,0,0,,乂利亞大人已經召集了三怪人。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.38,0:14:44.82,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,主人？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.82,0:14:45.82,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,為了什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.82,0:14:48.96,Main,Hildon,0,0,0,,草帽魯夫好像已經被抓住了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.96,0:14:51.72,Main,Hildon,0,0,0,,是時候喚醒900號了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.72,0:14:53.14,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,900號？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.14,0:14:54.28,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,你認真的嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.28,0:14:56.05,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,阿布大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.05,0:14:59.28,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,阿布薩羅姆你這混蛋！出來跟我結婚！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.28,0:15:01.75,Main,Lola,0,0,0,,你又消失逃跑了吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.11,0:15:03.83,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,奇怪...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.83,0:15:06.17,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,他們沒有其他地方可以跑了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.06,0:15:10.97,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,喂，乂瑪西！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.97,0:15:13.51,Main,Bearsy,0,0,0,,阿布薩羅姆大人，我有個問題...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.51,0:15:14.86,Main,Bearsy,0,0,0,,有件事讓我很在意...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.86,0:15:18.17,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,等等，先聽我說。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.17,0:15:21.02,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,有三個海賊從這裡經過嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.83,0:15:23.37,Main,Bearsy,0,0,0,,那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.37,0:15:24.94,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,阿布薩羅姆！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.46,0:15:27.33,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,你在這裡做什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.33,0:15:28.59,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,這是我的房間。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.59,0:15:29.69,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,乂洛娜。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.11,0:15:33.17,Main,Bearsy,0,0,0,,歡迎回來，乂洛娜大人...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.17,0:15:34.56,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,不准說話，乂瑪西！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.56,0:15:36.66,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,我要說幾次你才明白？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.02,0:15:38.71,Main,Bearsy,0,0,0,,可是，有件很重要的事─
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.71,0:15:39.63,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,安靜！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.63,0:15:40.62,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,不准出聲。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.89,0:15:44.52,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,妳對乂瑪西還是一如既往地嚴厲...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.52,0:15:45.29,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,嚴厲霸。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.29,0:15:47.30,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,安靜，他是我的部下。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.66,0:15:49.98,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,更重要的是，你聽說了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.98,0:15:52.94,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,主人在召喚我們。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.94,0:15:54.15,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,發生什麼事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.15,0:15:56.23,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,發生什麼事了？告訴你發生了什麼！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.23,0:15:58.56,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,900號要被喚醒了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.56,0:16:00.10,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,900號？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.97,0:16:02.82,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,他抓住那個三億男了嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.82,0:16:05.81,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,總之，我們暫時勉強躲過了他們。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.82,0:16:03.52,Secondary,Absalom,0,0,0,,他抓住那個三億男了嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.81,0:16:07.11,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,簡直是奇蹟。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.11,0:16:11.35,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,話說回來，我們為什麼要躲在這種地方？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.35,0:16:13.25,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,沒辦法啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.25,0:16:16.61,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我沒想到那個野獸男會追得這麼快！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.61,0:16:19.65,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,而且，我覺得那傢伙不是殭屍。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.65,0:16:21.96,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,等機會來了我們就離開，知道嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.96,0:16:24.00,Main,Hildon,0,0,0,,阿布薩羅姆大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.00,0:16:25.87,Main,Hildon,0,0,0,,原來你在這裡。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.87,0:16:27.76,Main,Hildon,0,0,0,,我帶來了有趣的情報。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.76,0:16:28.59,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,什麼事？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.98,0:16:32.70,Main,Hildon,0,0,0,,除了海賊之外，還有另一個入侵者。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.70,0:16:34.47,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,入侵者？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.47,0:16:36.93,Main,Hildon,0,0,0,,「鼻歌」俠客劍士。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.93,0:16:38.60,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.96,0:16:47.65,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,有人...從天而降。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.88,0:16:50.15,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,喂，剛才掉下來的是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.21,0:16:52.40,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,難道...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.94,0:16:54.78,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.78,0:16:57.87,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,看標記就知道了...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.61,0:17:17.24,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,剛才的打斷還真奇怪，不過你休想逃走。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.76,0:17:21.18,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,我要多少落腳點就能做多少。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.18,0:17:23.68,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,猴子！猴子！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.04,0:17:26.58,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你，幫我爭取點時間。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.58,0:17:28.35,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,你要做什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.35,0:17:30.77,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,這裡的石柱還真不錯。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.77,0:17:33.30,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我來做個小武器。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.69,0:17:36.87,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}蜘蛛...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.87,0:17:38.49,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,150)}黏網！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.21,0:17:41.66,Thoughts,Robin,0,0,0,,從他手上的腺體...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.06,0:17:43.22,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}六輪花...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.06,0:17:43.22,Note,Robin,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}六朵花
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.62,0:17:48.29,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}掌摑！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.15,0:17:53.37,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,有東西碰到我的眼睛了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.37,0:17:55.09,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,我被黏住了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.09,0:17:59.07,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,我被自己的黏網纏住了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.07,0:18:01.64,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,好了，妮可·羅賓，我準備好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.64,0:18:03.13,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,退後。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.13,0:18:04.39,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,那是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.39,0:18:09.54,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,什麼，我只不過是把隨身帶的鐵雙節棍插進這些柱子裡。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.67,0:18:15.34,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,對付這麼巨大的怪物，需要同樣巨大的武器。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.79,0:18:18.51,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}沉重雙節棍！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.39,0:18:26.38,Thoughts,Spider,0,0,0,,他的力量是怎麼回事...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.38,0:18:28.83,Thoughts,Spider,0,0,0,,他...真的是人類嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.45,0:18:41.78,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,給我住手，混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.97,0:18:44.61,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}蜘蛛黏網！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.79,0:18:54.27,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}武器...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.27,0:18:55.27,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,150)}左手！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.99,0:19:05.83,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,妮可·羅賓！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.31,0:19:08.00,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,那些是什麼東西？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.00,0:19:12.50,Main,Mouse,0,0,0,,老鼠！老鼠！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.02,0:19:14.27,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,抱歉...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.27,0:19:15.36,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,我大意了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.36,0:19:17.46,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,沒想到還有其他蜘蛛。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.14,0:19:27.68,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,可、可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.41,0:19:32.92,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,笨蛋...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.92,0:19:35.26,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,猴子，猴子...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.30,0:19:40.17,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,這不是你大不大意的問題。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.17,0:19:43.79,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,這些是我的部下，蜘蛛鼠。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.79,0:19:48.13,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,在Thriller Bark上有多達500隻。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.13,0:19:53.42,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,我們從來沒讓任何一個獵物逃脫過！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.93,0:19:59.13,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,我們在各處埋伏等待。從黑暗和死角中捕捉敵人。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.13,0:20:04.80,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,我們的絲線經過乂乂乂克大人的改造，任何人類的力量都無法撕裂！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.11,0:20:11.58,Main,Mouse,0,0,0,,在宅邸裡，我們從天花板上把你們的夥伴抓走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.58,0:20:15.98,Main,Mouse,0,0,0,,現在，我們要把你們帶到跟你們夥伴一樣的地方去。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.98,0:20:18.36,Main,Mouse,0,0,0,,死心吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.79,0:20:22.98,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,ヨホホホー\NYohohohoo
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.98,0:20:26.60,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,ヨーホホーホー\NYoohoohohoo
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.60,0:20:29.04,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,ヨホホホー\NYohohohoo
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.04,0:20:30.45,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,ヨーホホーホー\NYoohoohohoo
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.93,0:20:27.92,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,是誰？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.92,0:20:29.89,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,是誰在唱歌？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.25,0:20:35.64,Jungle P lyrics,Brook,0,0,0,,ビンクスの酒を\NGoing to deliver Bink's sake...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.64,0:20:44.22,Jungle P lyrics,Brook,0,0,0,,届けにゆくよ海風気まかせ波まかせ\NDoing as one pleases, following the sea breeze between the waves...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.05,0:20:51.17,Jungle P lyrics,Brook,0,0,0,,潮の向こうで夕日も騒ぐ\NOn the other side of the tide, alarmed at the setting sun...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.17,0:20:56.49,Jungle P lyrics,Brook,0,0,0,,空にゃ輪をかく鳥の唄\NDrawing a circle in the sky, the song of a bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.74,0:21:03.28,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,哎呀呀，看來所有人都來到這座島了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.45,0:21:06.43,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,你是怎麼從下面上來的？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.43,0:21:09.60,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,我跳上來的。畢竟我很輕。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.60,0:21:12.25,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,你既然來了，那就沒辦法了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.10,0:21:15.75,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,我來告訴你們這座島的一切。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.02,0:21:18.02,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,喂，混蛋！你是誰？！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.02,0:21:19.21,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,你不是殭屍！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.10,0:21:22.13,Main,Spider,0,0,0,,你是那些海賊的同伴吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.44,0:21:23.67,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,喂，骷髏！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.52,0:21:26.40,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,是的，是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.40,0:21:27.64,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,沒事了...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.48,0:21:30.98,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,我已經結束了這場戰鬥。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.91,0:21:36.52,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}三步必殺：
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.52,0:21:37.92,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,150)}燕口斬！
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,

